(memory "intent/todo-example" :when "a task of several steps begins and should be tracked as a todo, or a step finished and its todo mark must move")
(intent/todo "label"...) sets todo list, every item open. Label kept from list before keeps its done mark.
(intent/check "label") marks one todo done. Unknown label fails and names open ones.
Code checks each item, never memory. Work returns, item done at once. Work raises: check never runs, item stays open. Promise work: await before check.
Write intent forms inside the code, never a step of their own: intent/doing before each slow call, intent/check chained after the form that does the work, intent/progress per item in a loop. User sees each update live while step runs.
(intent/todo "sum scores" "average")
(let ((scores '(3 9 4)))
  (let ((total (apply + scores)))
    (intent/check "sum scores")
    (let ((mean (/ total (length scores))))
      (intent/check "average")
      (list total mean))))

(memory "intent/user-view" :when "the agent is deciding whether a step shows in chat, or the user asks what they see of the agent's work")
User sees only: intent line, todo list, rendered ui, tabs opened beside chat,
questions, final answer. Say intent through these forms.

(memory "intent/progress" :when "the agent is about to work through a list, a loop of known size or a batch of items one by one")
Known step count (loop over N items, batch): intent/progress each item. Named
steps: intent/todo.
- (intent/progress done total ["label"]) progress bar, done of total. Integers,
  total at least 1, done at most total. Independent of todo.
- Write intent/progress inside the loop, never a step of its own. User sees each
  update live while step runs.

(let ((i 0) (n 3))
  (dolist (issue '("a" "b" "c"))
    (setq i (+ i 1))
    (intent/progress i n "issues")))

(memory "intent/todo-edit" :when "the plan changed while work was under way, so a todo item must be removed, moved or the whole list cleared")
Plan changed: edit list, keep it true.
Label kept from list before keeps its done mark. (intent/doing "text") replaces line before.
- (intent/drop "label") removes one todo. Unknown label fails and names open ones.
- (intent/move "label" position) moves it, 0 first. Position past the end puts
  it last.
- (intent/clear) empties list.

(memory "intent/ask" :when "the agent cannot go on without a choice from the user among a closed set of answers, one or several")
(intent/ask "prompt" '("A" "B") [:multi t]) closed question, one pick; :multi t
allows several. Ends turn after this step. Answer arrives as next message.
(intent/ask "Which board?" '("Sales" "Support"))

(memory "intent/ui-view" :when "the agent is about to build a rendered ui view for the user, or test one before showing it")
Build ui view and test it without rendering. ui/render only once it works.
